// Thesis Example 4 (Listing 23) - One base fact guarded by three anti-joins.
// REPL query:  p(A, B, C).
// Expected:    (no solutions)  -- b(1,2,3) is rejected because q(2) holds

b(1, 2, 3). d(2). d(3).

q(X)          :- d(X).
p(X, Y, Z)    :- b(X, Y, Z), not q(X), not q(Y), not q(Z).

//test p(A, B, C). => empty
